      <TextObject Name="Text11" Left="387.45" Top="113.4" Width="302.4" Height="103.95" Text="51 Tower, Office no. 708/709, Marasi Drive, &#13;&#10;Business Bay, Dubai, U.A.E&#13;&#10;Phone: +971-04-2952296 Mobile: +971-55-6698536&#13;&#10;Email: majid@susallc.ae &amp; susallc@eim.ae&#13;&#10;Website: www.susashipping.com&#13;&#10;" HorzAlign="Center" VertAlign="Center" Font="Arial, 10pt, style=Bold"/>
      <LineObject Name="Line4" Left="348.55" Top="219.85" Width="368.55" Diagonal="true"/>
      <TextObject Name="Text12" Left="359.1" Top="217.35" Width="359.1" Height="151.2" Text="RECEIVED by the CARRIER the Goods as specified above in apparent good order and condition unless otherwise stated, to be transported to such place as agreed, authorised or permitted herein and subject to all the terms and conditions appearing on the front and reverse of this Bill of Lading to which the Merchant agrees by accepting this Bill of Lading, any local privileges and customs notwithstanding. The particulars given above as stated by the shipper and the weight, measure, quantity, condition, contents and value of the Goods are unknown to the Carrier.&#13;&#10;In WITNESS whereof one (1) original Bill of Lading have been signed if not otherwise stated below, the same being accomplished the other(s), if any, to be void. one (1) original Bill of Lading must be surrendered duly endorsed in exchange for the Goods or delivery order." VertAlign="Center" Font="Arial, 7pt"/>
